# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BioMate self-hosted BioNeMo NIM stack — environment
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env.bionemo` (same directory) and fill in real values.
# `.env.bionemo` is git-ignored (see deploy/bionemo/.gitignore) — never commit
# a real NGC key.
#
#   cp .env.bionemo.example .env.bionemo
#   docker compose -f docker-compose.bionemo.yml up -d
#
# Referenced by docker-compose.bionemo.yml (env_file + ${..._TAG} substitution).

# ── NGC access ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Personal/Org API key from https://ngc.nvidia.com/setup/api-key .
# Used both for `docker login nvcr.io` (username = $oauthtoken) AND injected
# into each NIM container at runtime for weight download + license validation.
NGC_API_KEY=nvapi-REPLACE_ME

# ── Image tags — PLACEHOLDERS: CONFIRM EACH ON THE NGC CATALOG ────────────────
# https://catalog.ngc.nvidia.com  →  find each model's NIM  →  copy the exact
# repository path AND tag. The repository paths in docker-compose.bionemo.yml
# (nvcr.io/nim/<vendor>/<model>) are the documented NGC pattern but MAY differ
# per model/release — adjust the compose `image:` if the catalog path differs.
# Do NOT ship these guessed defaults to production unverified.
BOLTZ2_TAG=PLACEHOLDER_CONFIRM_ON_NGC
GENMOL_TAG=PLACEHOLDER_CONFIRM_ON_NGC
MOLMIM_TAG=PLACEHOLDER_CONFIRM_ON_NGC
EVO2_TAG=PLACEHOLDER_CONFIRM_ON_NGC
DIFFDOCK_TAG=PLACEHOLDER_CONFIRM_ON_NGC

# ── (Optional) NIM runtime tuning ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Most NIMs accept NIM_* env vars (batch size, cache dir, log level). Leave
# unset for defaults; consult each NIM's model card. Examples:
# NIM_CACHE_PATH=/opt/nim/.cache
# NIM_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# What BioMate's Galaxy backend needs (set on the BACKEND container, NOT here) —
# reproduced for convenience. See the runbook.
#
#   BIONEMO_MODE=self_host
#   BIONEMO_SELF_HOST_URL=http://<gateway-host>:8000
#   # optional per-model route overrides if your gateway maps differently:
#   # BIONEMO_SELF_HOST_PATH_BOLTZ2=/boltz2/predict
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
